SUMMARY:Basic Introduction to American Sign Language
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics in communicating in American Sign Language. 
 Refresh and build upon your skills in the use of American Sign Language. 
 Registration begins March 1.\n\nRegistering for this class will register 
 you for the entire 6-week series.\n\nRegistration Opens September 26.
